DESCRIPTION >
    api_key_events — /v1 usage per API key (masked, never raw).
SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime `json:$.timestamp`,
    `wallet` String `json:$.wallet`,
    `key_masked` String `json:$.key_masked`,
    `tokens` UInt64 `json:$.tokens`
ENGINE >
    MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY >
    timestamp, wallet
